<h1 class="page-title max-w-3xl">Secure Edge Computing</h1>
      <p>MEAICON engineers edge computing platforms for environments where failure is not an option — where devices operate in hostile, contested, or disconnected conditions beyond the traditional security perimeter. Our platforms protect mission-critical data through a defence-in-depth architecture with five interlocking security layers, each independently hardened to ensure compromise at any one layer does not cascade into mission failure.</p>
      <p>From defence deployments to critical infrastructure, we design edge platforms that maintain integrity, confidentiality, and availability under the most demanding operational conditions across the our region.</p>
